        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Boogu Turbo- Text to Image\n\nGenerate high-quality images from text prompts using the Boogu Turbo model, a distilled 10B-parameter text-to-image pipeline that produces photorealistic outputs in just 4 steps. The workflow accepts one text prompt and outputs a single 1024x1024 image. Ideal for rapid prototyping of photorealistic concepts, generating marketing visuals, and creating bilingual text-rendered images with strong prompt adherence. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/image_boogu_image_0_1_turbo_t2i.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
